-- הסכם קיבוצי (שכר) לעניין תנאי העסקה של עובדי הוראה ברפורמת "אופק חדש"
-- (19.10.2022): the wage agreement for 1.1.2020–31.12.2026. Who it covers
-- and for how long; for Ofek Hadash teachers (chapter B) the new combined
-- salary tables, the Ofek 2022 supplement, the principals' personal
-- supplement kept in shekels, raised role-allowance rates and their shekel
-- minimums, trips, the preparation day, the partner kindergarten teacher,
-- school activities, special education, physiotherapists' clothing, the
-- non-academic new teacher, the maximum employment, the retention grant,
-- the school-role allowance, the transferred principal, the integration
-- and split allowances agreed in principle, and the part-time teacher; for
-- pre-reform teachers (chapter C) the 2022 shekel supplement; and for all
-- (chapter D) the welfare fund, two vacation days, special contracts, the
-- managers' global salary, exhaustion of claims, industrial peace, the
-- disputes cancelled and the follow-up committee.
--
-- The annexes the agreement names (the tables א1–א9, ב1–ב7, ג1–ג7 and
-- annex ה) are not in this document; the corpus publishes them in the
-- signed copy, so here each is a named input. The base agreement of
-- 25.12.2008 is encoded section by section in its own directory; a rule
-- here that changes one of its sections takes what that section says as an
-- input and names it. The follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025
-- corrects §§4, 6 and 29 of this agreement; it is a document of its own.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT parties

-- Time is counted in SALARY MONTHS where the text speaks of a salary
-- ("ממשכורת חודש ינואר 2023"): `month` y m is month m of year y, and a
-- salary "of" a month is that month's (convention dates.salary-month).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

-- The day most of chapter B's changes start from.
`1 September 2023` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023

§ `הסכם השכר של אופק חדש — 19.10.2022`


-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 A recital: the difficulty of recruiting and keeping quality teaching staff.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: flexibility and management tools to meet the schools' needs.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the Director-General's letter of 19.10.2022 on the vacation calendar and the union's answer; §29 applies them.

-- The recital names the two sets of terms the chapters below divide by,
-- and the period negotiated, 1.1.2020 to 31.12.2026 (§3).
@ref akn:preamble/p12
DECLARE `terms of employment` IS ONE OF
    `Ofek Hadash terms`
    `pre-reform terms`
    `other terms`

-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties reached the agreements this agreement anchors.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- akn:chp_1 The heading of chapter A (general); its articles follow.

§§ `1 הוראות כלליות`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1__para_1-1
DECLARE `part of the agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the preamble`
    `the body of the agreement`
    `an annex`

GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the agreement` `the preamble` AND `binds as the agreement` `an annex`

@ref akn:art_1__para_1-2 akn:art_1__para_1-3
DECLARE `form of a word` IS ONE OF masculine, feminine, singular, plural

GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word written in one form reads in another` masculine feminine FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a word written in one form reads in another` singular plural TRUE

@ref akn:art_1__para_1-4
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

@ref akn:art_1__para_1-5
GIVEN `the instrument's standing` IS A NUMBER, `mentioned in this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the standing of an administrative instrument` `the instrument's standing` `mentioned in this agreement` IS
    `the instrument's standing`

§§ `2 תחולה`

@desc An employee, as far as §2 asks who the agreement covers.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in an educational institution`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `terms`                                              IS A `terms of employment`
    `the part in question is under the letters of 11.11.2013` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the part of the employment whose terms the wages commissioner's letters to the union of 11.11.2013 set
    `teaching in an ulpan`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a guidance role paid on Ofek Hadash terms or by §12(ב) or §12(ג) of the guides' agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the guides' agreement of 9.11.2016
    `in a college that trains teaching employees, under the agreement of 7.5.2015 or of 21.1.2019` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee as §2 defines one` e IF
        e's `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education`
    AND e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND e's `employed in an educational institution`
    AND (e's `terms` EQUALS `Ofek Hadash terms` OR e's `terms` EQUALS `pre-reform terms`)
    AND NOT e's `the part in question is under the letters of 11.11.2013`
    AND NOT e's `teaching in an ulpan`

-- ¶2 and ¶3 say "for the avoidance of doubt": the guides are in, the
-- colleges out.
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/p3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the agreement` e IF
        (   `a teaching employee as §2 defines one` e
         OR (    e's `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education`
             AND e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
             AND e's `in a guidance role paid on Ofek Hadash terms or by §12(ב) or §12(ג) of the guides' agreement`))
    AND NOT e's `in a college that trains teaching employees, under the agreement of 7.5.2015 or of 21.1.2019`

`an ulpan teacher on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS
    `employee` WITH
        `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education` IS TRUE
        `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`           IS TRUE
        `employed in an educational institution`            IS TRUE
        `terms`                                             IS `Ofek Hadash terms`
        `the part in question is under the letters of 11.11.2013` IS FALSE
        `teaching in an ulpan`                              IS TRUE
        `in a guidance role paid on Ofek Hadash terms or by §12(ב) or §12(ג) of the guides' agreement` IS FALSE
        `in a college that trains teaching employees, under the agreement of 7.5.2015 or of 21.1.2019` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the agreement` `an ulpan teacher on Ofek Hadash terms`

§§ `3 תקופת ההסכם`

@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the agreement's period` d IF
        (d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2020))
    AND (d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2026))

#ASSERT `in the agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2026)
#ASSERT NOT `in the agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2027)

§ `פרק ב' — תנאי אופק חדש`

@ref akn:chp_2 akn:chp_2/p1
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chapter B applies to an employee on` t IF
    t EQUALS `Ofek Hadash terms`

§§ `4 עדכון טבלאות שכר משולב`

DECLARE `combined-salary table` IS ONE OF
    `the table in force on the eve of the signing`
    `annex א` HAS `annex number` IS A NUMBER

-- 4.1: from 1.9.2022 annexes א1–א8 take the place of the tables in force
-- on the eve of the signing; 4.2: from 1.9.2023 annex א9 takes the place
-- of א8. `n` is the number of the annex (1–8) that replaces a table in 4.1.
-- (The follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025, §§1–2, places some
-- teachers as if the tables changed on 2.9.2022 and 2.9.2023.)
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-2
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the combined-salary table in force` n d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` AND n EQUALS 8
    THEN `annex א` 9
    ELSE (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
          THEN `annex א` n
          ELSE `the table in force on the eve of the signing`)

#ASSERT `the combined-salary table in force` 8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023) EQUALS `annex א` 9
#ASSERT `the combined-salary table in force` 8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2023) EQUALS `annex א` 8
#ASSERT `the combined-salary table in force` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2022) EQUALS `the table in force on the eve of the signing`

-- 4.1 (and 5.1, 27.1): the increase from 1.9.2022 is paid from the salary
-- of January 2023, with arrears back to 1.9.2022: the salary month in which
-- an increase for a month is paid.
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary that pays the 2022 increase for the salary month` m IS
    max m (`month` 2023 1)

#ASSERT `the salary that pays the 2022 increase for the salary month` (`month` 2022 9) EQUALS `month` 2023 1
#ASSERT `the salary that pays the 2022 increase for the salary month` (`month` 2023 3) EQUALS `month` 2023 3

@ref akn:art_4/p1
`§4 changes a rule of the combined salary other than its tables` MEANS FALSE

§§ `5 תוספת אופק 2022`

DECLARE `Ofek 2022 annexes` IS ONE OF
    `no Ofek 2022 supplement`
    `annexes ב1 to ב7`
    `annexes ג1 to ג7`

@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Ofek 2022 annexes`
DECIDE `the Ofek 2022 annexes in force` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN `annexes ג1 to ג7`
    ELSE (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
          THEN `annexes ב1 to ב7`
          ELSE `no Ofek 2022 supplement`)

#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 annexes in force` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) EQUALS `annexes ב1 to ב7`
#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 annexes in force` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 10 2023) EQUALS `annexes ג1 to ג7`

-- 5.3: in proportion to the position, compared with a full position. The
-- text sets no ceiling, so above a full position too (convention
-- position.above-full).
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-3
GIVEN `the annex amount for the grade` IS A NUMBER, `position share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek 2022 supplement` `the annex amount for the grade` `position share` IS
    `the annex amount for the grade` `pro rata to a position of` `position share`

#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement` 800 0.5 EQUALS 400

DECLARE `salary purpose` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements computed on the combined salary`
    `the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements`
    `the hour value, and the pay for substitution and school-activity hours`
    `the salary reduction for an hour of absence`
    `the payment under §33(ד) of the base agreement`
    `severance pay`
    `pension-fund contributions`
    `training-fund contributions`
    `other contributions and deductions usual on the combined salary`
    `the determining salary of a budgetary pension`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`

-- 5.4–5.5: salary "for every purpose", every purpose listed included, and
-- the determining salary of a budgetary pension (5.5).
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-4 akn:art_5__para_5-5
GIVEN p IS A `salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ofek 2022 supplement counts for` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `the Ofek 2022 supplement counts for` `the determining salary of a budgetary pension`

@ref akn:art_5__para_5-6
`the Ofek 2022 supplement changes the rules of the shekel supplement of 19.3.2017` MEANS FALSE

§§ `6 תוספת אישית אחוזית למנהלים`

-- §6: at each update of the tables (4.1, 4.2), the rate of a principal's
-- personal supplement under §72 of the base agreement becomes C = A / B,
-- so that its shekel amount is kept.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6/p2 akn:art_6/p3 akn:art_6/p4 akn:art_6/p5 akn:art_6/p6 akn:art_6/p7
GIVEN `the shekel amount` IS A NUMBER, `the new table salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the updated personal supplement rate` `the shekel amount` `the new table salary` IS
    `the shekel amount` DIVIDED BY `the new table salary`

-- The example: 15% of 16,664.9 before; a new table salary of 20,436.7.
@ref akn:art_6/p8 akn:art_6__para_1 akn:art_6__para_1/p2 akn:art_6__para_1/p3
`the example's new rate` MEANS `the updated personal supplement rate` 2499.6 20436.7
#ASSERT `the example's new rate` `to the nearest` 0.0001 EQUALS 12.23%

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-a: the example prints the shekel amount as
-- 2,499.6, which is 15% of 16,664; 15% of the 16,664.9 it prints is
-- 2,499.735. The rate it reaches is 12.23% either way.
`the example's shekel amount is 15% of 16,664, not of 16,664.9` MEANS
        (NOT (15% TIMES 16664.9 EQUALS 2499.6))
    AND 15% TIMES 16664 EQUALS 2499.6
#ASSERT `the example's shekel amount is 15% of 16,664, not of 16,664.9`
#ASSERT (`the updated personal supplement rate` (15% TIMES 16664.9) 20436.7) `to the nearest` 0.0001 EQUALS 12.23%

DECLARE `manager with a personal supplement` IS ONE OF
    `a principal entitled under §72`
    `a first deputy entitled under §99`

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-b: §6 names the principals of §72 only. The
-- follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025, §6, says the first deputies
-- (§99) were left out by mistake and applies §6 to them.
@ref akn:art_6__para_1/p4 akn:art_6__para_2
GIVEN m IS A `manager with a personal supplement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§6 updates the personal supplement of` m IF
    m EQUALS `a principal entitled under §72`

`§6 names no first deputy` MEANS
    NOT `§6 updates the personal supplement of` `a first deputy entitled under §99`
#ASSERT `§6 names no first deputy`

-- 6.1, last two paragraphs, and 6.2: C replaces §72's own method; nothing
-- else about the supplement, or about the 2016 shekel supplement, changes.
`§72's own method sets the rate when the tables are updated` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_6__para_1/p5 Says the agreement does not change the rules of the 2016 shekel supplement; no rule turns on it here.

§§ `7 גמול ייעוץ`

DECLARE `counsellor's licence` IS ONE OF `a temporary licence`, `a permanent licence`

@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_7-1 akn:art_7__para_7-1__subpara_7-1-1 akn:art_7__para_7-1__subpara_7-1-2
GIVEN l IS A `counsellor's licence`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the highest counselling allowance rate` l d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN (IF l EQUALS `a temporary licence` THEN 12% ELSE 18%)
    ELSE (IF l EQUALS `a temporary licence` THEN 8% ELSE 12%)

#ASSERT `the highest counselling allowance rate` `a permanent licence` `1 September 2023` EQUALS 18%

@ref akn:art_7__para_7-2
`§7 changes the counselling allowance's other rules, or the rate of one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

§§ `8 גמול סגנות`

@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8__para_8-1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the deputy allowance rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` THEN 20% ELSE 13%

@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2
`§8 changes the deputy allowance's other rules, or the rate of one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

§§ `9 גמול ניהול חטיבה צעירה`

@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_9-1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the junior-division management allowance rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` THEN 20% ELSE 13%

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-2
`§9 changes the junior-division management allowance's other rules` MEANS FALSE

§§ `10 סכום שקלי מינימלי לגמולי תפקיד`

DECLARE `role with a shekel minimum` IS ONE OF
    `class education`
    `first-grade class education`
    `grade coordination` HAS `classes in the grade` IS A NUMBER
    `junior-division management`
    `deputy`
    `kindergarten management` HAS `the rate §138(א)(1) sets` IS A NUMBER @desc the rate of the combined salary §138(א)(1) of the base agreement sets; an input

-- The percentage each of 10.1–10.5 sets beside its shekel minimum. 10.2:
-- "עד 4 כיתות" 7% and "מעל 4" 6%. By convention thresholds.above "מעל 4"
-- leaves 4 out; "עד 4" is read to take it in, as in §39(א)(9) of the base
-- agreement, so that a grade of 4 classes is in a row (the exception is
-- recorded under thresholds.until). 10.3 and 10.4: "13% (or 20% by the
-- date of the increase)" — §§8–9 raise both to 20% from 1.9.2023, the day
-- §10 starts, so within §10 the rate is 20%.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-1__cls_10-1-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-2__subpara_10-2-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2__subpara_10-2-1__cls_10-2-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-3 akn:art_10__para_10-3__subpara_10-3-1 akn:art_10__para_10-3__subpara_10-3-1__cls_10-3-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-4 akn:art_10__para_10-4__subpara_10-4-1 akn:art_10__para_10-4__subpara_10-4-1__cls_10-4-1-1 akn:art_10__para_10-5 akn:art_10__para_10-5__subpara_10-5-1 akn:art_10__para_10-5__subpara_10-5-1__cls_10-5-1-1
GIVEN r IS A `role with a shekel minimum`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate §10 compares` r d IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `class education` THEN 10%
    WHEN `first-grade class education` THEN 11.5%
    WHEN `grade coordination` classes THEN IF classes `is above` 4 THEN 6% ELSE 7%
    WHEN `junior-division management` THEN `the junior-division management allowance rate` d
    WHEN `deputy` THEN `the deputy allowance rate` d
    WHEN `kindergarten management` rate THEN rate

@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-1__cls_10-1-1-2 akn:art_10__para_10-2__subpara_10-2-1__cls_10-2-1-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3__subpara_10-3-1__cls_10-3-1-2 akn:art_10__para_10-4__subpara_10-4-1__cls_10-4-1-2 akn:art_10__para_10-5__subpara_10-5-1__cls_10-5-1-2
GIVEN r IS A `role with a shekel minimum`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel minimum` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `class education` THEN 1000
    WHEN `first-grade class education` THEN 1000
    WHEN `grade coordination` classes THEN 1100
    WHEN `junior-division management` THEN 1100
    WHEN `deputy` THEN 1100
    WHEN `kindergarten management` rate THEN 1500

-- From 1.9.2023 the allowance is the higher of the two. F-ofek-hadash-wage-
-- 2022-c: the text does not say whether the shekel minimum is for a full
-- position. 10.6 makes every rule of the percentage allowance the shekel
-- allowance's rule, and the percentage is of a combined salary that follows
-- the position; the minimum is read the same way (convention
-- position.fixed-sum), above a full position too (position.above-full).
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-6
GIVEN r IS A `role with a shekel minimum`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `position share` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance under §10` r `combined salary` `position share` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN max (`the rate §10 compares` r d TIMES `combined salary`)
             ((`the shekel minimum` r) `pro rata to a position of` `position share`)
    ELSE `the rate §10 compares` r d TIMES `combined salary`

#ASSERT `the role allowance under §10` (`grade coordination` 4) 11387.80 1 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 1100
#ASSERT `the role allowance under §10` `junior-division management` 11387.80 1 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 2277.56
#ASSERT `the role allowance under §10` (`grade coordination` 4) 20000 1 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 1400

-- The agreement's claim for the root (MMS-548): the junior-division head's
-- allowance at a full position from 1.9.2023, when §9 raises the rate to 20%
-- and §10 adds the shekel minimum; before then the 13% is the base
-- agreement's §124(ב), which this one changes and does not restate.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the junior-division head's allowance according to the agreement of 19.10.2022` c IS
    IF (c's `the salary month`) `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN JUST (`the role allowance under §10` `junior-division management` (c's `combined salary today`) 1 (c's `the salary month`))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- The contradictions page's card layer-coordinator (MMS-533): the ministry's
-- simulator pays a layer coordinator a flat 6% with no class count and no
-- floor; on 11,387.80 that is 683.27 where §10 gives 1,100. True while the
-- agreement's rule and the flat 6% disagree.
`§10's layer-coordinator allowance is not a flat 6%` MEANS
    NOT (`the role allowance under §10` (`grade coordination` 4) 11387.80 1 `1 September 2023`
         EQUALS 11387.80 TIMES (6%))
#ASSERT `§10's layer-coordinator allowance is not a flat 6%`

-- The other reading: the minimum is paid whole, whatever the position.
GIVEN r IS A `role with a shekel minimum`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance with the minimum paid whole` r `combined salary` d IS
    max (`the rate §10 compares` r d TIMES `combined salary`) (`the shekel minimum` r)

`a half-position class educator's minimum is 500 by the reading and 1,000 read whole` MEANS
        `the role allowance under §10` `class education` 4000 0.5 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 500
    AND `the role allowance with the minimum paid whole` `class education` 4000 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `a half-position class educator's minimum is 500 by the reading and 1,000 read whole`

@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1__subpara_10-1-2 akn:art_10__para_10-2__subpara_10-2-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3__subpara_10-3-2 akn:art_10__para_10-4__subpara_10-4-2 akn:art_10__para_10-5__subpara_10-5-2 akn:art_10__para_10-6/p2
`§10 changes another rule of these allowances, or applies to one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

§§ `11 גמול רכז חינוך חברתי`

DECLARE `school stage` IS ONE OF `a primary school`, `a junior high school`

@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-2
GIVEN s IS A `school stage`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the social-education coordinator's rate` s d IS
    IF s EQUALS `a junior high school` THEN 10%
    ELSE (IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` THEN 8% ELSE 6%)

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-3
`§11 changes the social coordinator's other rules, or the rate of one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

§§ `12 גמול תפקיד לרכז פדגוגי`

@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12__para_12-1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pedagogical coordinator's rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` THEN 8% ELSE 6%

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2
`§12 changes the pedagogical coordinator's other rules, or the rate of one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

-- The agreement's claim for the root (MMS-521): §12.1 raises the rate from
-- 1.9.2023; before then the 6% is the agreement of 19.3.2017's, which this
-- one changes and does not restate, so it speaks from that day only.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to the agreement of 19.10.2022` c IS
    IF (c's `the salary month`) `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN JUST (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate` (c's `the salary month`))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- How the agreement describes itself as an instrument (MMS-521), for the root.
`the agreement of 19.10.2022` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement"
        `title`         IS "הסכם השכר מיום 19.10.2022, סעיף 12"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 10 2022
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

§§ `13 גמול ליווי טיולים ופעילות חוץ בית ספרית`

-- 13.1.1: from 1.9.2023 §4.ג of the trips agreement of 8.9.1998 reads: an
-- activity unit is 0.7% of the monthly combined salary FOR A FULL POSITION,
-- not by the teacher's position. Before, the trips agreement's own unit
-- (outside the corpus) applies, an input.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1__subpara_13-1-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1__subpara_13-1-1/p2
GIVEN `full-position monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `the unit before` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the value of an activity unit` `full-position monthly combined salary` `the unit before` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN 0.7% TIMES `full-position monthly combined salary`
    ELSE `the unit before`

#ASSERT `the value of an activity unit` 10000 0 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 70

-- 13.1.2: in §4.ח of the trips agreement and §40(ד) of the base agreement,
-- "fewer than 4 hours" becomes "fewer than 7 hours".
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1__subpara_13-1-2
GIVEN `hours employed that day` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a day of fewer hours than §4.ח and §40(ד) name` `hours employed that day` d IF
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN `hours employed that day` LESS THAN 7
    ELSE `hours employed that day` LESS THAN 4

#ASSERT `a day of fewer hours than §4.ח and §40(ד) name` 6 `1 September 2023`

DECLARE `escort pay annex` IS ONE OF
    `annex א of the trips agreement`
    `annex ה of this agreement`

-- 13.1.3: annex ה (not in this document; an input wherever it is used)
-- replaces annex א of the trips agreement for escorting on a free day or a
-- short day.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1__subpara_13-1-3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `escort pay annex`
DECIDE `the annex that pays escorting on a free or short day` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN `annex ה of this agreement`
    ELSE `annex א of the trips agreement`

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2
`§13 changes the trip allowance's other rules` MEANS FALSE

§§ `14 יום היערכות`

-- 14.1: a teacher who took part in the preparation day (of up to six
-- hours) may leave undone up to two individual hours in the first week and
-- up to four stay hours (for work meetings) in the first two months: at
-- most six in all, and never more than the hours worked that day. "עד"
-- here caps a count of hours and takes the number in (the exception is
-- recorded under thresholds.until).
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-2 akn:art_14__para_14-1/p3
GIVEN `hours worked on the preparation day` IS A NUMBER, `individual hours left undone` IS A NUMBER, `stay hours left undone` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher may leave these hours undone after a preparation day` `hours worked on the preparation day` `individual hours left undone` `stay hours left undone` IF
        `individual hours left undone` AT MOST 2
    AND `stay hours left undone` AT MOST 4
    AND `individual hours left undone` PLUS `stay hours left undone` AT MOST `hours worked on the preparation day`

#ASSERT `a teacher may leave these hours undone after a preparation day` 6 2 4
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher may leave these hours undone after a preparation day` 5 2 4
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher may leave these hours undone after a preparation day` 6 3 3

-- 14.2: a kindergarten teacher's preparation day is held as one of the
-- professional-development meetings with the inspector, in August, and
-- counts among the meetings of the school year that begins the next
-- September.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-2/p2
GIVEN `the year of the August meeting` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school year the kindergarten preparation day counts in` `the year of the August meeting` IS
    `the year of the August meeting`

@ref akn:art_14__para_14-3
`the further pay for taking part in a preparation day` MEANS 0
`§14 takes away from the travel reimbursement for the preparation day` MEANS FALSE

§§ `15 תוספת לגננת עמיתה`

@desc A kindergarten teacher, as far as §15 asks.
DECLARE `kindergarten teacher` HAS
    `placed as the teacher in charge on a fixed day the head teacher does not work` IS A BOOLEAN @desc in ordinary or special education, doing every duty of the one in charge that day
    `gets the kindergarten-management allowance of §138(א)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gets the class-education allowance of §138(ב)`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `gets a trailing management or counselling allowance of §50א or §140(ו)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gets the cluster-management allowance of §144ג(א)`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `gets a salary-protection component`                  IS A BOOLEAN @desc any, including those of §§38ב and 38ג of the base agreement
    `full-position combined salary`                       IS A NUMBER
    `her position share`                                  IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15__para_15-1 akn:art_15__para_15-1/p2
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a partner kindergarten teacher` k IF
    k's `placed as the teacher in charge on a fixed day the head teacher does not work`

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-1/p3 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_15-1-1 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_15-1-2 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_15-1-3 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_15-1-4 akn:art_15__para_15-1__subpara_15-1-5
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible partner kindergarten teacher` k IF
        `a partner kindergarten teacher` k
    AND NOT k's `gets the kindergarten-management allowance of §138(א)`
    AND NOT k's `gets the class-education allowance of §138(ב)`
    AND NOT k's `gets a trailing management or counselling allowance of §50א or §140(ו)`
    AND NOT k's `gets the cluster-management allowance of §144ג(א)`
    AND NOT k's `gets a salary-protection component`

-- 15.2: from 1.9.2023, 10% of her combined salary, by her position; above a
-- full position, a full position's supplement (the text's own ceiling).
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-2
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten teacher`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the partner kindergarten teacher's supplement` k d IS
    IF `an eligible partner kindergarten teacher` k AND d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN 10% TIMES k's `full-position combined salary` TIMES min (k's `her position share`) 1
    ELSE 0

`a partner at 120%` MEANS
    `kindergarten teacher` WITH
        `placed as the teacher in charge on a fixed day the head teacher does not work` IS TRUE
        `gets the kindergarten-management allowance of §138(א)` IS FALSE
        `gets the class-education allowance of §138(ב)`       IS FALSE
        `gets a trailing management or counselling allowance of §50א or §140(ו)` IS FALSE
        `gets the cluster-management allowance of §144ג(א)`  IS FALSE
        `gets a salary-protection component`                  IS FALSE
        `full-position combined salary`                       IS 10000
        `her position share`                                  IS 1.2
#ASSERT `the partner kindergarten teacher's supplement` `a partner at 120%` `1 September 2023` EQUALS 1000

DECLARE `pension action` IS ONE OF
    `act to recognise the partner supplement as a fixed supplement for the pensions law`

-- 15.3: no deadline beyond "soon after the signing" (convention
-- dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-3
`recognising the partner supplement for pension` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to recognise the partner supplement as a fixed supplement for the pensions law`

-- 15.4: what it counts for — a closed list (convention reading.closed-list);
-- it is not part of the combined salary and is the base of no other
-- supplement. Pension contributions are for an eligible partner insured in
-- an accrual pension, at the rates of chapter ו §1(ב) of the agreement of
-- 30.12.2009.
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-4
GIVEN p IS A `salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the partner supplement counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the hour value, and the pay for substitution and school-activity hours` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `severance pay` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the salary reduction for an hour of absence` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the payment under §33(ד) of the base agreement` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `training-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `pension-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the partner supplement counts for` `percentage supplements computed on the combined salary`

§§ `16 פעילויות בית ספריות`

-- 16.1.1: the ceiling on each activity of §30(ג)(1)–(3) is struck out.
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16__para_16-1 akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_16-1-1
`§30(ג) sets a ceiling of hours for each of its activities` MEANS FALSE

-- 16.1.2 adds §30(ג)(4) to the base agreement, and 16.2 adds §6(ד)(4) to
-- the agreement of 17.9.2013: a meeting before the opening of the school
-- year, of up to 3 hours. "עד 3 שעות" caps the hours the meeting counts for
-- and takes 3 in (the exception is recorded under thresholds.until).
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_16-1-2 akn:art_16__para_16-2 akn:art_16__para_16-2/p2
GIVEN `hours of the meeting` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the activity hours a meeting before the opening of the school year counts for` `hours of the meeting` IS
    min `hours of the meeting` 3

#ASSERT `the activity hours a meeting before the opening of the school year counts for` 3 EQUALS 3

DECLARE `activity action` IS ONE OF
    `divide the activity hours among the activities of §30(ג)`

-- 16.1.3 adds §30(ג)א: the principal decides how the hours are divided,
-- by the school's needs.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_16-1-3
`dividing the activity hours` MEANS
    PARTY `the principal`
    MAY   `divide the activity hours among the activities of §30(ג)`

-- 16.3: from 1.9.2023, 40 activity hours for the whole school year in place
-- of 18 in each half; the halves are gone.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-3
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `hours in the first half` IS A NUMBER, `hours in the second half` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `school-activity hours within the maximum` d `hours in the first half` `hours in the second half` IF
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN `hours in the first half` PLUS `hours in the second half` AT MOST 40
    ELSE `hours in the first half` AT MOST 18 AND `hours in the second half` AT MOST 18

#ASSERT `school-activity hours within the maximum` `1 September 2023` 30 10
#ASSERT NOT `school-activity hours within the maximum` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 30 10

@ref akn:art_16__para_16-4
`§16 changes another rule of school-activity hours` MEANS FALSE

§§ `17 גמול חינוך מיוחד`

@desc A teacher with the special-education allowance, as far as §17 asks.
DECLARE `special-education teacher` HAS
    `the rate on the eve of the signing`  IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance's rate on the eve of the signing
    `under §39(א)(4)`                     IS A BOOLEAN @desc the 9% allowance of §39(א)(4) of the base agreement, not the special-education allowance of §39(א)(3)
    `in a Matia`                          IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in a Matia (a regional support centre)
    `gets the class-educator allowance of §50` IS A BOOLEAN @desc §50 of the base agreement, as amended by §37 of the agreement of 29.2.2012
    `for hours in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a class the Ministry defines so by circular נח/8(ב); the rate is for the hours taught in it

-- 17.1.4 defines the eligible Matia teacher.
@ref akn:art_17__para_17-1__subpara_17-1-4
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible Matia teacher` t IF
        t's `in a Matia`
    AND NOT t's `gets the class-educator allowance of §50`
    AND t's `the rate on the eve of the signing` EQUALS 9%

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-d: 17.1.1 raises 9% to 10% "except Matia
-- teachers, to whom 17.1.4 or 17.1.5 applies". A Matia teacher with the
-- class-educator allowance at 9% is not an eligible Matia teacher, so
-- 17.1.4–17.1.5 do not reach him; the exception is read to take out only
-- the teachers they reach (convention reading.qualifier: the clause "אשר
-- יחול לגביהם" restricts the words it follows), so he gets 10% by 17.1.1.
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excepted from 17.1.1` t IF
    `an eligible Matia teacher` t

@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17__para_17-1 akn:art_17__para_17-1__subpara_17-1-1 akn:art_17__para_17-1__subpara_17-1-2 akn:art_17__para_17-1__subpara_17-1-3 akn:art_17__para_17-1__subpara_17-1-5
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education allowance rate` t d IS
    IF NOT d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
    THEN t's `the rate on the eve of the signing`
    ELSE (IF `an eligible Matia teacher` t
          THEN (IF t's `for hours in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class` THEN 17% ELSE 15%)
          ELSE (IF t's `under §39(א)(4)`
                THEN t's `the rate on the eve of the signing`
                ELSE (IF t's `the rate on the eve of the signing` EQUALS 14%
                      THEN (IF t's `for hours in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class` THEN 17% ELSE 15%)
                      ELSE (IF t's `the rate on the eve of the signing` EQUALS 9% AND NOT `excepted from 17.1.1` t
                            THEN 10%
                            ELSE t's `the rate on the eve of the signing`))))

GIVEN eve IS A NUMBER, matia IS A BOOLEAN, educator IS A BOOLEAN, autism IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `special-education teacher`
DECIDE `a special-education teacher with` eve matia educator autism IS
    `special-education teacher` WITH
        `the rate on the eve of the signing` IS eve
        `under §39(א)(4)`                    IS FALSE
        `in a Matia`                         IS matia
        `gets the class-educator allowance of §50` IS educator
        `for hours in an autism or severe-mental-disorder class` IS autism

#ASSERT `the special-education allowance rate` (`a special-education teacher with` (9%) FALSE FALSE FALSE) `1 September 2023` EQUALS 10%
#ASSERT `the special-education allowance rate` (`a special-education teacher with` (14%) FALSE FALSE TRUE) `1 September 2023` EQUALS 17%
#ASSERT `the special-education allowance rate` (`a special-education teacher with` (9%) TRUE FALSE FALSE) `1 September 2023` EQUALS 15%
#ASSERT `the special-education allowance rate` (`a special-education teacher with` (9%) TRUE FALSE TRUE) `1 September 2023` EQUALS 17%

-- The other reading takes every Matia teacher out of 17.1.1, and leaves the
-- Matia teacher with the class-educator allowance at 9%.
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate with every Matia teacher excepted from 17.1.1` t IS
    IF t's `in a Matia` AND (NOT `an eligible Matia teacher` t) AND t's `the rate on the eve of the signing` EQUALS 9%
    THEN 9%
    ELSE `the special-education allowance rate` t `1 September 2023`

`a Matia class educator at 9% gets 10% by the reading and 9% by the other` MEANS
        `the special-education allowance rate` (`a special-education teacher with` (9%) TRUE TRUE FALSE) `1 September 2023` EQUALS 10%
    AND `the rate with every Matia teacher excepted from 17.1.1` (`a special-education teacher with` (9%) TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 9%
#ASSERT `a Matia class educator at 9% gets 10% by the reading and 9% by the other`

@ref akn:art_17__para_17-2
`§17 changes the allowance's other rules, or the rate of one not on Ofek Hadash terms` MEANS FALSE

§§ `18 ביגוד`

@desc A teaching employee of the health professions, as far as §18 asks.
DECLARE `health-professions teacher` HAS
    `a teaching employee of the health professions of §20 of the base agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a professional certificate in physiotherapy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `treats by physiotherapy in the role` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_18 akn:art_18/p1
GIVEN p IS A `health-professions teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a physiotherapist` p IF
        p's `a teaching employee of the health professions of §20 of the base agreement`
    AND p's `holds a professional certificate in physiotherapy`
    AND p's `treats by physiotherapy in the role`

-- 18.1: from 1.9.2023, once a year in the salary of July, 800 for a full
-- position, on top of the clothing allowance. 18.2: by the rules of the
-- PE teachers' clothing agreement of 17.11.2011 (outside the corpus), whose
-- share for a part position is an input.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-1 akn:art_18__para_18-2
GIVEN p IS A `health-professions teacher`, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, `the share the rules of 17.11.2011 pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the physiotherapists' clothing supplement in the salary of` p y m `the share the rules of 17.11.2011 pay` IS
    IF `a physiotherapist` p AND m EQUALS 7 AND `month` y m AT LEAST `month` 2023 9
    THEN 800 TIMES `the share the rules of 17.11.2011 pay`
    ELSE 0

`a physiotherapist on the scale` MEANS
    `health-professions teacher` WITH
        `a teaching employee of the health professions of §20 of the base agreement` IS TRUE
        `holds a professional certificate in physiotherapy` IS TRUE
        `treats by physiotherapy in the role` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `the physiotherapists' clothing supplement in the salary of` `a physiotherapist on the scale` 2024 7 1 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the physiotherapists' clothing supplement in the salary of` `a physiotherapist on the scale` 2023 7 1 EQUALS 0

§§ `19 מורים המשובצים טרם היותם אקדמאים`

DECLARE `table by education` IS ONE OF `the senior table`, `the certified table`, `the uncertified table`

@desc A new teacher, as far as the §36(ז) that 19.1 adds asks.
DECLARE `new teacher` HAS
    `an academic`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled to intern pay under §§145–148`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `placed by the Ministry's approval in an exceptional case, for a set time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the seniority step recognised IDF or national service in teaching gives` IS A NUMBER @desc by §37 of the base agreement; 0 where there is none
    `education`                                      IS A `table by education`

DECLARE `placement` HAS
    `grade`     IS A NUMBER
    `seniority` IS A NUMBER
    `table`     IS A `table by education`

@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19__para_19-1
GIVEN t IS A `new teacher`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `placement`
DECIDE `the placement under §36(ז)` t d IS
    IF      d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
        AND t's `placed by the Ministry's approval in an exceptional case, for a set time`
        AND NOT t's `an academic`
        AND NOT t's `entitled to intern pay under §§145–148`
    THEN JUST (`placement` WITH
                  `grade`     IS 1
                  `seniority` IS (IF t's `the seniority step recognised IDF or national service in teaching gives` GREATER THAN 0
                                  THEN t's `the seniority step recognised IDF or national service in teaching gives`
                                  ELSE 1)
                  `table`     IS t's `education`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- 19.2: §§51, 59, 60 and 61 of the base agreement are void from 1.9.2023,
-- save for one who signed, before 30.6.2023, an undertaking to complete an
-- academic degree within four years.
@ref akn:art_19__para_19-2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `signed the undertaking before 30.6.2023` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§§51, 59, 60 and 61 apply` d `signed the undertaking before 30.6.2023` IF
    (NOT (d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`)) OR `signed the undertaking before 30.6.2023`

#ASSERT NOT `§§51, 59, 60 and 61 apply` `1 September 2023` FALSE
#ASSERT `§§51, 59, 60 and 61 apply` `1 September 2023` TRUE

§§ `20 היקף העסקה מקסימלי`

DECLARE `approver` IS ONE OF
    `a district teaching-staff manager`
    `a school principal`
    `another`

-- 20.1: in §33(ד) of the base agreement, "or the school principals" joins
-- the district teaching-staff managers, from the school year תשפ"ד (that
-- begins in 2023). A school year is named by the year it begins in.
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20__para_20-1
GIVEN a IS AN `approver`, `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may approve under §33(ד)` a `school year beginning` IF
       a EQUALS `a district teaching-staff manager`
    OR (a EQUALS `a school principal` AND `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2023)

#ASSERT `may approve under §33(ד)` `a school principal` 2023
#ASSERT NOT `may approve under §33(ד)` `a school principal` 2022

@ref akn:art_20__para_20-2
`§20 changes another rule of §33(ד)` MEANS FALSE

§§ `21 מענק שימור`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as §21 asks.
DECLARE `retention-grant teacher` HAS
    `a teaching employee as §2 defines one` IS A BOOLEAN
    `began in the civil service at the Ministry on` IS A DATE
    `on Ofek Hadash terms` IS A BOOLEAN
    `had actual teaching seniority before beginning` IS A BOOLEAN @desc other than IDF or national service recognised as actual teaching seniority
    `employed continuously until permanent status` IS A BOOLEAN @desc broken by any school year not recognised towards permanent status, save maternity and parenthood
    `position share on entering permanent status` IS A NUMBER
    `an employee of §27(ד) or §27(ה) of the base agreement` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21/p1 akn:art_21__para_21-1 akn:art_21__para_21-1/p2 akn:art_21__para_21-1__subpara_21-1-1 akn:art_21__para_21-1__subpara_21-1-2 akn:art_21__para_21-1__subpara_21-1-3 akn:art_21__para_21-1__subpara_21-1-4 akn:art_21__para_21-1__subpara_21-1-5
GIVEN t IS A `retention-grant teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `eligible for the retention grant` t IF
        t's `a teaching employee as §2 defines one`
    AND (t's `began in the civil service at the Ministry on` `is on or after` `1 September 2023`)
    AND t's `on Ofek Hadash terms`
    AND NOT t's `had actual teaching seniority before beginning`
    AND t's `employed continuously until permanent status`
    AND (   t's `an employee of §27(ד) or §27(ה) of the base agreement`
         OR t's `position share on entering permanent status` AT LEAST 70%)

-- 21.2: the relevant period is the 36 months before the April that
-- precedes the May of payment. F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-e: 21.5's second
-- paragraph counts "36 החודשים שקדמו לחודש מאי" — the 36 months before the
-- May itself, one month later at both ends. The period 21.2 defines, and
-- the example follows, is read (convention reading.same-meaning: a defined
-- term keeps its definition).
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-2
GIVEN `year of payment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first month of the relevant period` `year of payment` IS
    `month` (`year of payment` MINUS 3) 4

GIVEN `year of payment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last month of the relevant period` `year of payment` IS
    `month` `year of payment` 3

GIVEN `year of payment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first of the 36 months §21.5 counts` `year of payment` IS
    `month` (`year of payment` MINUS 3) 5

`§21.2 and §21.5 count different 36 months` MEANS
    NOT (`the first month of the relevant period` 2029 EQUALS `the first of the 36 months §21.5 counts` 2029)
#ASSERT `§21.2 and §21.5 count different 36 months`
#ASSERT `the last month of the relevant period` 2029 MINUS `the first month of the relevant period` 2029 PLUS 1 EQUALS 36

@desc A stretch of the relevant period at one position share.
DECLARE `stretch of the period` HAS
    `months`         IS A NUMBER
    `share of a position in the stretch` IS A NUMBER
    `counted`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc FALSE for maternity and parenthood, reserve duty, unpaid sick leave and any time without a right to salary (21.5)

-- 21.2–21.5: the weighted position share over the months counted; each
-- month above a full position counts as a full one (21.3); a month not
-- counted is out of the numerator and the denominator.
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-2/p2 akn:art_21__para_21-3 akn:art_21__para_21-5 akn:art_21__para_21-5/p2
GIVEN stretches IS A LIST OF `stretch of the period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weighted position share for the grant` stretches IS
    IF `months counted` EQUALS 0
    THEN 0
    ELSE sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `months` TIMES min (s's `share of a position in the stretch`) 1) `the stretches counted`)
         DIVIDED BY `months counted`
    WHERE
        `the stretches counted` MEANS filter (GIVEN s YIELD s's `counted`) stretches
        `months counted`        MEANS sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `months`) `the stretches counted`)

-- 21.4: never more than 10,000.
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-4
GIVEN t IS A `retention-grant teacher`, stretches IS A LIST OF `stretch of the period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retention grant` t stretches IS
    IF `eligible for the retention grant` t
    THEN 10000 TIMES `the weighted position share for the grant` stretches
    ELSE 0

-- 21.11, the example: from 1.9.2025 at 80%; maternity from 1.12.2027; back
-- on 1.3.2028 at 80%; permanent on 1.9.2028 at 90%; paid in May 2029.
-- (The corpus marks "31.11.2027" as printed.) 2,710% / 33 = 82 4/33 %, and
-- the grant 8,212.12, which the example prints to the shekel.
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-11 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p2 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p3 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p4 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p5 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p6 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p7 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p8 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p9 akn:art_21__para_21-11/p10
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER, c IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `stretch of the period`
DECIDE `a stretch of` n share c IS
    `stretch of the period` WITH
        `months`         IS n
        `share of a position in the stretch` IS share
        `counted`        IS c

`the example's period` MEANS
    LIST `a stretch of` 20 (80%) TRUE,
         `a stretch of` 3 (80%) FALSE,
         `a stretch of` 6 (80%) TRUE,
         `a stretch of` 7 (90%) TRUE

`the example's teacher` MEANS
    `retention-grant teacher` WITH
        `a teaching employee as §2 defines one` IS TRUE
        `began in the civil service at the Ministry on` IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025
        `on Ofek Hadash terms` IS TRUE
        `had actual teaching seniority before beginning` IS FALSE
        `employed continuously until permanent status` IS TRUE
        `position share on entering permanent status` IS 90%
        `an employee of §27(ד) or §27(ה) of the base agreement` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the first month of the relevant period` 2029 EQUALS `month` 2026 4
#ASSERT `the last month of the relevant period` 2029 EQUALS `month` 2029 3
#ASSERT sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `months`) `the example's period`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the weighted position share for the grant` `the example's period` EQUALS 2710% DIVIDED BY 33
#ASSERT `to the nearest whole` (`the retention grant` `the example's teacher` `the example's period`) EQUALS 8212

DECLARE `absence at the time of payment` IS ONE OF
    `at work`
    `on unpaid leave or leave treated as unpaid`
    `on sick leave without pay`
    `in maternity and parenthood`
    `absent for a work injury not charged to sick leave`

-- 21.6: the grant is paid in the salary of the May after entering permanent
-- status, or at the latest the next month's; 21.10: if at that time the
-- teacher is away for one of 21.10.1–21.10.4, in the first salary on
-- returning to work, or at the latest the next. The months are salary
-- months; the May after entering permanent status is an input.
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-6 akn:art_21__para_21-10 akn:art_21__para_21-10__subpara_21-10-1 akn:art_21__para_21-10__subpara_21-10-2 akn:art_21__para_21-10__subpara_21-10-3 akn:art_21__para_21-10__subpara_21-10-4
GIVEN `the May after entering permanent status` IS A NUMBER, absence IS AN `absence at the time of payment`, `the first salary month back at work` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month the grant may be paid in` `the May after entering permanent status` absence `the first salary month back at work` IS
    IF absence EQUALS `at work`
    THEN `the May after entering permanent status` PLUS 1
    ELSE `the first salary month back at work` PLUS 1

#ASSERT `the last salary month the grant may be paid in` (`month` 2029 5) `at work` 0 EQUALS `month` 2029 6

-- 21.7–21.8: not salary for any purpose; nothing it counts for, no
-- contributions, and not in topping up to the minimum wage. 21.9: the
-- salary base of the table is unchanged.
@ref akn:art_21__para_21-7 akn:art_21__para_21-8 akn:art_21__para_21-9
GIVEN p IS A `salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the retention grant counts for` p IF
    FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the retention grant counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`

§§ `22 גמול תפקיד בית ספרי`

DECLARE `institution` IS ONE OF
    `an elementary school`
    `a middle school`
    `a special-education school`
    `a centre for the gifted`
    `an agricultural farm`
    `a marine centre`
    `another institution`

-- 22.1: from the school year תשפ"ו (beginning 1.9.2025) and every year, the
-- principal of one of these institutions may set school roles. (The
-- approved agreement of 29.6.2025, §19, puts the start a year later, at
-- תשפ"ז.)
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_22__para_22-1
GIVEN i IS AN `institution`, `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may set school roles` i `school year beginning` IF
        `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2025
    AND NOT i EQUALS `another institution`

-- 22.2: two to five units for a role, in whole units, within the units the
-- Ministry allocates to the school.
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-2 akn:art_22__para_22-2/p2
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a number of units a principal may set` units IF
        units AT LEAST 2
    AND units AT MOST 5
    AND units EQUALS FLOOR units

-- 22.4: 200 a month for each unit; the example: four units, 800.
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-4
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly value of the units` units IS
    200 TIMES units

#ASSERT `the monthly value of the units` 4 EQUALS 800

-- 22.6, 22.9: a teacher of a third of a position or more who fills the
-- role is paid its full shekel value; 22.10: above a full position, a full
-- position's amount (the same). 22.8: not a principal. F-ofek-hadash-wage-
-- 2022-f: 22.6 says "שליש משרה" and 22.9 "שליש משרה (33.33%)"; 33.33% is a
-- little less than a third. The gloss the text gives is read as the measure
-- (convention precedence.gloss).
`a third of a position, as 22.9 glosses it` MEANS 33.33%

@ref akn:art_22__para_22-6 akn:art_22__para_22-8 akn:art_22__para_22-9 akn:art_22__para_22-10
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER, `position share` IS A NUMBER, `a principal` IS A BOOLEAN, `fills the role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school-role allowance` units `position share` `a principal` `fills the role` IS
    IF      `fills the role`
        AND NOT `a principal`
        AND `position share` AT LEAST `a third of a position, as 22.9 glosses it`
        AND `a number of units a principal may set` units
    THEN `the monthly value of the units` units
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the school-role allowance` 3 0.5 FALSE TRUE EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `the school-role allowance` 3 1.2 FALSE TRUE EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `the school-role allowance` 3 1 TRUE TRUE EQUALS 0

`a position between 33.33% and a third qualifies by 22.9 and not by 22.6` MEANS
        0.33331 AT LEAST `a third of a position, as 22.9 glosses it`
    AND 0.33331 LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
#ASSERT `a position between 33.33% and a third qualifies by 22.9 and not by 22.6`

DECLARE `school-role action` IS ONE OF
    `set as a school role a role the base agreement already pays an allowance for`
    `set the school roles and their units`
    `set the key that allocates the units to each school`

-- 22.3: the allowance replaces none of the existing ones, and no role with
-- an allowance of its own in the base agreement may be a school role.
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-3
`what the principal may not make a school role` MEANS
    PARTY `the principal`
    SHANT `set as a school role a role the base agreement already pays an allowance for`

-- 22.5 and 22.7: the roles and units are set at the start of every school
-- year, for a full year as a rule, and may differ from year to year; the
-- teacher has no right to go on in a role after the year (22.6).
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-5 akn:art_22__para_22-5/p2 akn:art_22__para_22-7
`setting the school roles` MEANS
    PARTY `the principal`
    MAY   `set the school roles and their units`
    WITHIN 1

`a school role carries over to the next school year` MEANS FALSE

-- 22.11–22.12: what it counts for — a closed list (convention
-- reading.closed-list); pension contributions at the rates of chapter ו
-- §1(א) or §1(ב) of the agreement of 30.12.2009; no training-fund
-- contributions; not part of the combined salary and the base of no other
-- supplement.
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-11 akn:art_22__para_22-12
GIVEN p IS A `salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school-role allowance counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the hour value, and the pay for substitution and school-activity hours` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the salary reduction for an hour of absence` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the payment under §33(ד) of the base agreement` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `severance pay` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `pension-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the school-role allowance counts for` `training-fund contributions`

-- 22.13: §39(ב) of the base agreement (two role allowances, a third with
-- the district manager's approval) applies; but where one of three is a
-- school role, no approval is needed.
@ref akn:art_22__para_22-13
GIVEN `role allowances` IS A NUMBER, `one of them is a school role` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the role allowances may all be paid` `role allowances` `one of them is a school role` `approved by the district manager` IF
       `role allowances` AT MOST 2
    OR (    `role allowances` EQUALS 3
        AND (`one of them is a school role` OR `approved by the district manager`))

#ASSERT `the role allowances may all be paid` 3 TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the role allowances may all be paid` 3 FALSE FALSE

@ref akn:art_22__para_22-14
`allocating the units` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `set the key that allocates the units to each school`
    WITHIN 12

§§ `23 שימור רמת מורכבות למנהל שהועבר`

@desc A principal, as far as §23 asks.
DECLARE `principal moved` HAS
    `moved on the Ministry's initiative, on a positive opinion, to strengthen a struggling school` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a permanent principal on the eve of the move` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moved to a school of a lower complexity level without a break in management` IS A BOOLEAN @desc maternity and parenthood, reserve duty and one sabbatical are no break (23.1.4)
    `moved with the senior teaching-staff division's approval, without a tender` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the complexity level of the school moved from` IS A NUMBER
    `still principal of the school moved to` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the new school's level has reached the old one since the move` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_23 akn:art_23__para_23-1 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-1 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-2 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-3 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-4 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-4__cls_23-1-4-1 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-4__cls_23-1-4-2 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-4__cls_23-1-4-3 akn:art_23__para_23-1__subpara_23-1-5
GIVEN p IS A `principal moved`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a transferred principal` p IF
        p's `moved on the Ministry's initiative, on a positive opinion, to strengthen a struggling school`
    AND p's `a permanent principal on the eve of the move`
    AND p's `moved to a school of a lower complexity level without a break in management`
    AND p's `moved with the senior teaching-staff division's approval, without a tender`

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-g: 23.1.4 speaks of "the continuity in clause
-- (ג) above"; 23.1's clauses are numbered 23.1.1–23.1.5 and none is (ג).
-- The continuity is 23.1.3's, the third (convention reading.misprint).
`the clauses of §23.1` MEANS LIST "23.1.1", "23.1.2", "23.1.3", "23.1.4", "23.1.5"
`23.1.4 cites a clause (ג) that §23.1 does not have` MEANS
    NOT elem "(ג)" `the clauses of §23.1`
#ASSERT `23.1.4 cites a clause (ג) that §23.1 does not have`

-- 23.2–23.3: from 1.9.2023 the table salary is by the level of the school
-- moved from, while he heads the school moved to, until that school's level
-- reaches it; from then on, by the new school's level. Moving out of the
-- role ends it.
@ref akn:art_23__para_23-2 akn:art_23__para_23-3 akn:art_23__para_23-3/p2
GIVEN p IS A `principal moved`, `the new school's level` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the complexity level the table salary is by` p `the new school's level` d IS
    IF      `a transferred principal` p
        AND d `is on or after` `1 September 2023`
        AND p's `still principal of the school moved to`
        AND NOT p's `the new school's level has reached the old one since the move`
        AND `the new school's level` LESS THAN p's `the complexity level of the school moved from`
    THEN p's `the complexity level of the school moved from`
    ELSE `the new school's level`

`a principal moved from level 4 to level 2` MEANS
    `principal moved` WITH
        `moved on the Ministry's initiative, on a positive opinion, to strengthen a struggling school` IS TRUE
        `a permanent principal on the eve of the move` IS TRUE
        `moved to a school of a lower complexity level without a break in management` IS TRUE
        `moved with the senior teaching-staff division's approval, without a tender` IS TRUE
        `the complexity level of the school moved from` IS 4
        `still principal of the school moved to` IS TRUE
        `the new school's level has reached the old one since the move` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the complexity level the table salary is by` `a principal moved from level 4 to level 2` 2 `1 September 2023` EQUALS 4

§§ `24–25 גמול שילוב וגמול פיצול — הסכמה עקרונית`

DECLARE `negotiation action` IS ONE OF
    `set the number of included pupils and the integration allowance's rate`
    `set the number of classes and the split allowance's rate`

-- §24: a percentage allowance for a class educator or kindergarten head in
-- ordinary education whose class holds more than a number of included
-- pupils (entitled to a personal basket, as §2 of the second schedule to
-- the Special Education Law, 1988, means one); §25: for a teacher of many
-- classes. The parties set the numbers and rates by 1.9.2023 and no later
-- than 31.12.2023, within the budget allocated; the allowances are paid
-- from 1.9.2024. The deadline is the later date, in days from the signing.
-- (The approved agreement of 29.6.2025, §21, freezes both in תשפ"ו.)
`days from the signing to 31.12.2023` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2023) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 19 10 2022)

@ref akn:art_24 akn:art_24/p1 akn:art_24/p2
`setting the integration allowance` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `set the number of included pupils and the integration allowance's rate`
    WITHIN `days from the signing to 31.12.2023`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§24: the number of included pupils and the allowance's rate are set by 31.12.2023"

@ref akn:art_25 akn:art_25/p1
`setting the split allowance` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `set the number of classes and the split allowance's rate`
    WITHIN `days from the signing to 31.12.2023`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§25: the number of classes and the allowance's rate are set by 31.12.2023"

`the integration and split allowances are paid from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024

#ASSERT `days from the signing to 31.12.2023` EQUALS 438

§§ `26 מורה במשרה חלקית`

-- 26.1: in §27(ג) of the base agreement, "a position below 50%" becomes
-- "below 70%" from 1.9.2023, and "below 80%" from 1.9.2024.
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26__para_26-1 akn:art_26__para_26-1/p2 akn:art_26__para_26-1/p3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position §27(ג) is below` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) THEN 80%
    ELSE (IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2023` THEN 70% ELSE 50%)

GIVEN `position share` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a part-time teacher under §27(ג)` `position share` d IF
    `position share` LESS THAN `the position §27(ג) is below` d

#ASSERT `a part-time teacher under §27(ג)` 0.75 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024)
#ASSERT NOT `a part-time teacher under §27(ג)` 0.75 `1 September 2023`

@ref akn:art_26__para_26-2
`§26 changes another rule for a part-time teacher` MEANS FALSE

§ `פרק ג' — תנאי העסקה טרום רפורמה`

@ref akn:chp_3 akn:chp_3/p1
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chapter C applies to an employee on` t IF
    t EQUALS `pre-reform terms`

§§ `27 תוספת שקלית אחידה ("עולם ישן")`

-- 27.1–27.2: from 1.9.2022, 500 for a full position, paid from the salary
-- of January 2023 back to 1.9.2022 (as §4.1's increase), in proportion to
-- the position; no ceiling (convention position.above-full).
@ref akn:art_27 akn:art_27__para_27-1 akn:art_27__para_27-2
GIVEN `position share` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2022 shekel supplement` `position share` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
    THEN 500 `pro rata to a position of` `position share`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the 2022 shekel supplement` 0.6 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) EQUALS 300

-- 27.3–27.5: salary for every purpose, save the 2001, 2008 and 2011
-- supplements and topping up to the minimum wage; in the determining salary
-- of a budgetary pension (27.4); an "excluded supplement" under the 2015
-- minimum-wage law.
@ref akn:art_27__para_27-3 akn:art_27__para_27-4 akn:art_27__para_27-5
GIVEN p IS A `salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2022 shekel supplement counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `topping up to the minimum wage`

#ASSERT `the 2022 shekel supplement counts for` `the determining salary of a budgetary pension`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2022 shekel supplement counts for` `the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements`

`the 2022 shekel supplement is an excluded supplement under the 2015 minimum-wage law` MEANS TRUE

§ `פרק ד' — כלל עובדי ההוראה`

@ref akn:chp_4 akn:chp_4/p1
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chapter D applies to an employee on` t IF
    `chapter B applies to an employee on` t OR `chapter C applies to an employee on` t

§§ `28 קרן רווחה`

-- From 1.9.2023, a further 17 million a year to the welfare fund the
-- follow-up committee set up on 15.4.2002. Amounts in millions of shekels.
@ref akn:art_28 akn:art_28/p1
`the further yearly budget of the welfare fund` MEANS 17

§§ `29 ימי חופשה`

DECLARE `kind of hour` IS ONE OF
    `a frontal hour`
    `a stay hour`
    `an individual hour`
    `a management hour`
    `a school-activity hour`
    `a kindergarten-activity hour`
    `a substitution hour`

-- ¶1: "system hours" are the hours the Ministry sets as working hours of
-- every kind, save single hours such as school or kindergarten activity
-- and substitution.
@ref akn:art_29 akn:art_29/p1
GIVEN h IS A `kind of hour`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a system hour` h IF
        NOT h EQUALS `a school-activity hour`
    AND NOT h EQUALS `a kindergarten-activity hour`
    AND NOT h EQUALS `a substitution hour`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as §29 asks.
DECLARE `vacation-day teacher` HAS
    `placed for a full school year`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `placed in a full position`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `must work on 13 Adar or the first day of the winter vacation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc by the placement and system hours, not as a substitute
    `must work on 18 Iyar or the first day of the spring vacation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc by the placement and system hours, not as a substitute

-- 29.1–29.1.3: two vacation days for a full school year; else one for each
-- of the two days the placement makes the teacher work. F-ofek-hadash-
-- wage-2022-h: 29.1 gives the two days to one "placed in a full position"
-- (the Director-General's letter as it reports it); 29.1.1, and the rules
-- below it, measure by the school year and the placement, not the
-- position. 29.1.1 is read (convention precedence.specific), so a part-time
-- teacher placed for the whole year has two days. (The follow-up
-- committee's decision of 14.1.2025, §7, adds a rule for the Arab sector.)
@ref akn:art_29__para_29-1 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-1 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-2 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-3 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-4/p2
GIVEN t IS A `vacation-day teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the vacation days for the school year` t IS
    IF t's `placed for a full school year`
    THEN 2
    ELSE (IF t's `must work on 13 Adar or the first day of the winter vacation` THEN 1 ELSE 0)
         PLUS (IF t's `must work on 18 Iyar or the first day of the spring vacation` THEN 1 ELSE 0)

GIVEN t IS A `vacation-day teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher 29.1 describes` t IF
    t's `placed for a full school year` AND t's `placed in a full position`

`a part-time teacher placed for the whole year` MEANS
    `vacation-day teacher` WITH
        `placed for a full school year`  IS TRUE
        `placed in a full position`      IS FALSE
        `must work on 13 Adar or the first day of the winter vacation` IS TRUE
        `must work on 18 Iyar or the first day of the spring vacation` IS TRUE

`29.1 and 29.1.1 part on a part-time teacher placed for the whole year` MEANS
        `the vacation days for the school year` `a part-time teacher placed for the whole year` EQUALS 2
    AND NOT `the teacher 29.1 describes` `a part-time teacher placed for the whole year`
#ASSERT `29.1 and 29.1.1 part on a part-time teacher placed for the whole year`

DECLARE `vacation action` IS ONE OF
    `take the vacation day`
    `refuse requests so that the days cannot be taken within the year`

-- 29.1.4–29.1.5: a teacher of 29.1.2–29.1.3 may take the day in that year
-- and only after working the dates named; 29.1.6: maternity and
-- parenthood, and reserve duty, count as work by the system hours.
@ref akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-4 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-5 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-6
GIVEN `worked the date` IS A BOOLEAN, `in maternity or reserve duty on the date` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may take the day earned by the date` `worked the date` `in maternity or reserve duty on the date` IF
    `worked the date` OR `in maternity or reserve duty on the date`

DECLARE `post` IS ONE OF
    `a principal of a school or other institution`
    `a deputy or teacher in a school or other institution`
    `a kindergarten teacher`

DECLARE `superior` IS ONE OF
    `the institution's inspector`
    `the principal of the institution`
    `the kindergarten's inspector`

-- 29.1.7: the day is set at the teacher's request with the superior's
-- approval, and the superior may not refuse so that the days cannot be
-- taken within the year.
@ref akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-7 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-7/p2 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-7/p3 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-7/p4 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-7/p5
GIVEN p IS A `post`
GIVETH A `superior`
DECIDE `the superior who approves the day` p IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `a principal of a school or other institution` THEN `the institution's inspector`
    WHEN `a deputy or teacher in a school or other institution` THEN `the principal of the institution`
    WHEN `a kindergarten teacher` THEN `the kindergarten's inspector`

`the superior's restraint` MEANS
    PARTY `the employee's superior`
    SHANT `refuse requests so that the days cannot be taken within the year`

-- 29.1.8–29.1.9: not carried to the next year, not redeemed for money; a day
-- not taken is struck out at the end of the school year.
@ref akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-8 akn:art_29__para_29-1__subpara_29-1-9
GIVEN `days not taken at the end of the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the days carried to the next year` `days not taken at the end of the year` IS
    0

`the pay for a vacation day not taken` MEANS 0

§§ `30 חוזים מיוחדים`

DECLARE `data action` IS ONE OF
    `send the union the share of employees on special contracts by district and institution`

-- ¶1: the collective agreements between the parties, and every other
-- arrangement, practice or provision for teaching employees, do not apply
-- to one employed on a special contract under the Director-General's
-- letter of 19.10.2022 (outside the corpus). ¶2: every January the data go
-- to the union.
@ref akn:art_30 akn:art_30/p1
GIVEN `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the collective agreements apply to the employee` `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022` IF
    NOT `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022`

@ref akn:art_30/p2
`the yearly data on special contracts` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `send the union the share of employees on special contracts by district and institution`
    WITHIN 31

§§ `31 שכר מנהלים וסגני מנהלים ראשונים — שכר גלובאלי`

DECLARE `claim action` IS ONE OF
    `raise a claim about the managers' global salary`
    `raise further economic demands for 1.1.2020–31.12.2026`
    `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`

@ref akn:art_31 akn:art_31__para_31-1
`the managers' salary pays for all their management work, whenever it is done` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_31__para_31-2
`no claim about the global salary` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `raise a claim about the managers' global salary`

§§ `32 מיצוי תביעות`

-- 32.1: the agreement exhausts every claim for 1.1.2020–31.12.2026, save the
-- numbers and rates of §§24–25, within their budget, on which the parties
-- negotiate. 32.2: the exhaustion provisions already binding stand.
@ref akn:art_32 akn:art_32__para_32-1 akn:art_32__para_32-1/p2 akn:art_32__para_32-2
`no further economic demands` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `raise further economic demands for 1.1.2020–31.12.2026`

`this agreement takes away from the exhaustion provisions already binding` MEANS FALSE

§§ `33 שקט תעשייתי`

@ref akn:art_33 akn:art_33__para_33-1
`industrial peace` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`)

@ref akn:art_33__para_33-2
`this agreement takes away from the industrial-peace provisions already binding` MEANS FALSE

§§ `34 ביטול סכסוכי עבודה`

@ref akn:art_34 akn:art_34/p1
GIVEN `declared on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a labour dispute the union declared stands` `declared on` IF
    NOT (`declared on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 19 10 2022))

#ASSERT NOT `a labour dispute the union declared stands` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 5 2022)

§§ `35 יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- The follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the Director-General
-- and the union's general secretary — follows the agreement and decides
-- disputes about it, finally and bindingly.
@ref akn:art_35 akn:art_35/p1
GIVEN `the committee's decision` IS A STRING, `a party's reading` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `what binds the parties in a dispute` `the committee's decision` `a party's reading` IS
    `the committee's decision`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signatories' posts; no rule.
